fix(buscar filters): neutral aseguradora placeholder, instant-apply only (no redundant button), no stuck focus ring

- Aseguradora placeholder is now the neutral field label "Aseguradora" / "Insurer"
  (was "Cualquiera" / "Any"); default stays unselected = unfiltered, X clears.
- Single filter behavior: instant-apply everywhere (matches the desktop sidebar);
  removed the redundant mobile drawer "Ver resultados" apply button — the X and
  the backdrop dismiss the drawer.
- Select trigger uses focus-visible (not focus) with a brand-blue ring, so a mouse
  click that returns focus to the trigger no longer leaves a stuck border/outline.

